<?xml version="1.0"?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns="https://w3id.org/eudpp/LCA#"
     xml:base="https://w3id.org/eudpp/LCA"
     xmlns:LCA="https://w3id.org/eudpp/LCA#"
     xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
     xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
     xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace"
     xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"
     xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
     xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
     xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/"
     xmlns:eudpp="https://w3id.org/eudpp#"
     xmlns:terms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="https://w3id.org/eudpp/LCA">
        <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/eudpp/LCA/3.1"/>
        <terms:created>2026-10-5</terms:created>
        <terms:creator xml:lang="en">Fatima Danash and Marc-Andree Wolf</terms:creator>
        <terms:description xml:lang="en">LCA (Life Cycle Assessment) module of an EU DPP (Digital Product Passport) core ontology proposal of the CIRPASS-2 European project.

SCOPE
This module covers the environmental-performance metadata that a DPP is required to carry under ESPR. It supports both (a) general LCA studies of any product, expressed via eudpp:LCAStudy, and (b) Environmental Product Declarations (EPDs) conforming to EN 15804+A2 with EF 3.1 characterisation, expressed via eudpp:EPDStudy (a subclass of LCAStudy). The controlled vocabulary of named individuals (impact indicators, inventory indicators, lifecycle modules, characterisation methods) follows EN 15804+A2 and EF 3.1. The module aligns structurally with the ILCD+EPD v1.3 data format (https://indatawg.github.io/ILCD-EPD-Data-Format/) and extends it with richer OWL semantics.It also relates to LCAnet/IA module (https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#).

DEPENDENCIES
This module has dependencies to the following EU DPP Core Ontology (CO) modules: ACTOR and P_DPP via CON.</terms:description>
        <terms:issued xml:lang="en">2026-10-19</terms:issued>
        <terms:license rdf:resource="https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0"/>
        <terms:license xml:lang="en">This ontology is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. In case of dispute over Apache 2.0 applicability, or in case considering the ontology as a document, this ontology document is to be considered licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).</terms:license>
        <terms:title xml:lang="en">LCA module of the CIRPASS-2 EU DPP Core Ontology</terms:title>
        <vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>eudpp</vann:preferredNamespacePrefix>
        <vann:preferredNamespaceUri>https://w3id.org/eudpp#</vann:preferredNamespaceUri>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The LCA module of the EU DPP core ontology, version 3.1</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">EU DPP LCA</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://indatawg.github.io/ILCD-EPD-Data-Format/"/>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://standards.cen.eu/dyn/www/f?p=204:110:0::::FSP_PROJECT:65243"/>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lcanet/ia#"/>
        <owl:versionInfo rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">3.1</owl:versionInfo>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


